      "question": "The institute's directors have decided to reinvest the budget surplus -- spending the extra money.",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "topic": "语法与词汇",
      "keywords": "grammar vocabulary collocation",
      "answer_explain": "instead of spending... 表示再投资而不是花掉，与两种资金用途之间的取舍相符。paid for、offers to 是动词结构，不能这样接在 reinvest 的宾语之后；apart from 表除……之外，不能表达此处明确的替代关系。",
      "question_translation": "研究所的主管们决定将预算结余再投资，**而不是**把这笔额外资金花掉。",
